---
import Section from "../components/common/Section.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getConfigurationCollection } from "../lib/utils";

const { data: config } = await getConfigurationCollection();
---

<Layout>
    <Fragment slot="head">
        <title>{config.aboutMeta.title}</title>
        <meta name="description" content={config.aboutMeta.description}/>
        <meta property="og:title" content={config.aboutMeta.title}/>
        <meta property="og:description" content={config.aboutMeta.description}/>
        <meta property="og:url" content={config.site.baseUrl} />
        <meta name="x:card" content="summary_large_image" />
        <meta name="x:title" content={config.aboutMeta.title} />
        <meta name="x:description" content={config.aboutMeta.description} />
        <meta http-equiv="content-language" content="en" />
        <meta name="language" content="English" />
        <link rel="canonical" href={config.site.baseUrl} />
    </Fragment>
    <Section class="mt-16">
            My name is Victor, and I like setting up systems and applications, and during my spare time I do security research.
            Previously worked in cloud computing, web development and system administration.<br><br>
            My email: <code>0xmvck</code><span>@</span><span>gm</span><span>ai</span><span>l.c</span><span>om</span><br><br>
            Some certs I've racked up:<br><br>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-8">
                <!-- <li>HTB CJCA and CPTS (in progress, and get out of my comments please!) </li> -->
                <li>Cisco Certified Ethical Hacker</li>
                <li>4xAWS Certified (Solutions Architect, SysOps, AI Fundamentals)</li>
                <li>Azure Certified (Azure Fundamentals)</li>
                <li>KCNA: Kubernetes and Cloud Native Associate</li>
                <li>Cloud Developer (Udacity Nanodegree)</li>
            </ul>
    </Section>
</Layout>
